    <li>Inventory each drive by serial before it leaves the rack — you'll need it for the certificate reconciliation.</li>
    <li>Chain of custody starts at the rack, not at pickup — document handoffs internally too.</li>
    <li>Per-drive certificates, not batch certificates, so you can reconcile.</li>
    <li>Asset register write-off happens after certificates are received and matched.</li>
